            <description><![CDATA[<html><body style="font-family:-apple-system,sans-serif"><h3>SkySaver 0.3.0</h3><ul><li>A real moon: true phase, gentle glow and pond reflection, bigger supermoons</li><li>Animation & interaction now freezes the rain and birds, while the sky colour follows the time</li><li>Settings opens inside the menu-bar card, and React to my cursor moved into it</li><li>Bird sound plays only at dawn and dusk, and the fireworks are removed</li><li>Smoother return from full-screen apps</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
